# Frontend environment template (Vercel).
#
# The frontend is currently PURE STATIC HTML (index.html, b2b.html) and has no
# build step, so NO environment variables are required to deploy it.
#
# Rules:
# - NEVER put secrets here. Anything exposed to the browser is public. Vite/Nuxt
#   style VITE_* / NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are compiled into shipped assets.
# - Set real values in the Vercel dashboard:
#     Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables (scope: Production/Preview).
# - Do not commit a populated .env file.
#
# The B2B portal (b2b.html) takes the API base at runtime from an input field,
# defaulting to https://dsaialap.banglarvoice24news.com. If a build step is
# introduced later, expose the API base only as a public value, e.g.:
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
